MintCurveConvexPosition::acceptOwnership()
├── given there is no pending owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given there is a pending owner
│   ├── when caller is not the pending owner
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   └── when caller is the pending owner
│       ├── it should set owner to the caller
│       ├── it should clear pendingOwner
│       └── it should emit OwnershipTransferred
├── given ownership has rolled over to a new owner
│   ├── when a spender authorized by the previous owner acts
│   │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
│   ├── when the previous owner acts
│   │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
│   ├── when the new owner authorizes a spender
│   │   └── it should let that spender manage the position and pay the new owner
│   └── when a spender the new owner authorized before the transfer acts
│       └── it should let that spender manage the position immediately after acceptance
└── given ownership is transferred back to the original owner
    └── when a spender the original owner authorized before acts
        └── it should regain access under the restored owner
